# Text keeps LF line endings on every platform: tests compare generated text with
# files in the repository (docs/COMMANDS.md) and scan the sources, and a Windows
# checkout would otherwise turn every line ending into CR LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Never text, whatever their first bytes look like.
*.rgba binary
*.misses binary
*.tile binary
*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.gz binary
*.kmz binary
*.mvt binary
*.pmtiles binary
*.planet binary
*.pub binary
# Fuzzing seeds are bytes, whatever their names say.
fuzz/seeds/** binary
